dropped  a server's own machinery: authorization, token and introspection endpoints, grants and models, which a program serves with `http` or `web`
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  authlib.oauth2.rfc6749.AuthorizationServer, ResourceProtector, TokenEndpoint, AuthorizationCodeGrant, ClientCredentialsGrant, RefreshTokenGrant, BaseGrant, ClientMixin, AuthorizationCodeMixin, TokenMixin, TokenValidator, authlib.oauth2.rfc8628.DeviceAuthorizationEndpoint, DeviceCodeGrant, DeviceCredentialMixin, DeviceCredentialDict, authlib.oidc.core.OpenIDCode, OpenIDHybridGrant, OpenIDImplicitGrant, OpenIDToken, AuthorizationCodeMixin, OpenIDJWTAuthenticationRequest, grants, models, authorization_server, resource_protector, token_endpoint, endpoint, wrappers

dropped  a context, an HTTP client or a session handed in, hooks and the type plumbing of each language
  go      oauth2.NoContext, oauth2.HTTPClient, oauth2.NewClient's context, oauth2.Config.Client, clientcredentials.Config.Client, jwt.Config.Client
  rust    oauth2::reqwest, oauth2::ureq, oauth2::curl, the async variants, ErrorResponse trait
  python  OAuth2Client.register_compliance_hook, authlib.oauth2.rfc6749.hooks, util, list_to_scope, scope_to_list, parameters, requests, OAuth2Request, OAuth2Payload, JsonPayload, JsonRequest, EndpointRequest, InsecureTransportError, MissingAuthorizationError, MissingTokenException, MissingTokenTypeException, UnsupportedTokenTypeError, authlib.common.security.is_secure_transport
